{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "132b8f81882d202030725e05b10bf2964ab80cf3d5b72ce5b6508ab77ff023de", "ja": "捕食者のTrap", "zh": "捕食者的Trap", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5c51c94ea89853a03a6e92aa4805486028b7602142d72ab28f32c2277df62755", "ja": "食事を終えたアイドル達だったが、出された\n料理の違和感に気づく。女主人の言動にも\n怪しさを感じ、逃げ出そうと画策。しかし\n体が思うように動かず困惑してしまう。\nそして、料理を食べるロコにも異変が……。", "zh": "偶像们吃完饭后，察觉到了端上来的料理有些不对劲。她们也觉得女主人的言行十分可疑，于是策划着逃走。然而身体却无法随心所欲地行动，让她们陷入了困惑。就连吃下料理的ROCO也发生了异变……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1000_025roc", "source_sha256": "08fefadbe4bef49c2c5af488edce990500d2c49b147dee245cb2b33ac6dbd255", "ja": "サンキューフォーザディナーです！\nとってもデリシャスでした～。", "zh": "谢谢这顿晚餐！\n真的太美味了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1001_onnnasyujin", "source_sha256": "f665bdf3cb9a1f6af2990a93b5b0cc5fd4a31708d7435a3e239bf1a16b2cf254", "ja": "ふふ、たくさん食べてくださってうれしいですわ。\n他の皆さんも、お口に合ったかしら？", "zh": "呵呵，您能吃这么多，我很开心。\n其他各位也还合口味吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "9972c6e3e3dc240c009148f82a1ce40e1fb8c160cff96eb012c72071d91475ac", "ja": "え、ええ。とってもおいしかったです。\n……。", "zh": "诶、嗯。非常好吃。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "1344f64546752c8a75ed05b993fca2bd6dda9f48b10dd249d1cfc976218ef0e9", "ja": "なぁ、杏奈。ふたりはああ言ってるけど……\n絶対おかしかったよな、さっきのハンバーグ。", "zh": "喂，杏奈。虽然她们俩都那么说……但刚才的汉堡肉绝对很奇怪吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "4a31de187790dd2037b71f9636996be72797f7605f4cf05858bc93ed5c60b1cc", "ja": "うん……いい匂いなのに、味、しなかった……。\n杏奈……あんなハンバーグ食べたの、初めて……。", "zh": "嗯……明明闻起来很香，却一点味道都没有……  \n杏奈……还是第一次吃到那样的汉堡肉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "691fb1ece8f26dfeb6352a5d463faf83d3240ee92f2c5ca65269e91460a6a43f", "ja": "……先程の電話での高木社長と音無さんも、\nやはり、どこかおかしかった気がします。", "zh": "……刚才通电话时，高木社长和音无小姐，\n也让人觉得确实有些不太对劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "f92538a2f7fe477ef883815539e300c97c4635ea066f47f1b5fb127d01329021", "ja": "一体、何が起こっているのかはわかりませんが、\nこれだけは言えそうです。……ここにいるのは、危険。", "zh": "虽然不知道究竟发生了什么，但有一点可以确定。……待在这里很危险。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "f7519108b50390d35d89e7b891b4ff940dba03fc0c730da603149e1753e7527c", "ja": "……っし。逃げるか！", "zh": "……好。赶紧溜吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "3614df12d3cb4597d447a2877e8fabfa4f312bd659e9997708fc19daaef76b26", "ja": "あの、すみません！\nお手洗いってどこに……わっ！？", "zh": "不好意思，打扰一下！\n请问洗手间在哪……哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "7635461c2a7e15f947e8b712e281b10113e8c0ec1c9eab287d109b8948a0a79c", "ja": "……いってて……転んじゃったよ。", "zh": "……好疼……摔倒了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "cd24ea86cc7cd4fdb5ce0ebb37ed7442d63446d54fe260d443bb4675b9b35bca", "ja": "昴さん、大丈夫……あ、あれ？\n立てない……ど、どうして？", "zh": "昴，你没事吧……啊，咦？\n站不起来……这、这是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "128dad00eddaed7140f1f6798092441f8010f5b2edc1ed6b0ff594af821403cd", "ja": "え、百合子も？　なんで？", "zh": "咦，百合子也？为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "d6f4b64981fa957526a788ad4d2192cde1942437d671c501a5edc36221395a56", "ja": "…………？\n……瑞希、さん。ロコが、なんか……変……？", "zh": "……？\n……瑞希，小姐。ROCO好像有点……奇怪……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1013_025roc", "source_sha256": "9333634b578d039cf8fa4269546b2948d9f779e2537cf6728fd045e93acc4cd2", "ja": "もぐもぐ……デリシャスです……もぐもぐ……\nデリシャスです、サンキューフォーザディナーです～！", "zh": "嚼嚼……好delicious……嚼嚼……\n太delicious了，thank you for the dinner～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "817eefd0ae8a8572c485a1765ff639375f0b023563067422c97eb17dbf21f5a2", "ja": "ご飯……\nもう、食べてないのに、食べてるみたい……？", "zh": "饭……\n明明已经没在吃了，却感觉好像还在吃……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "627b1c6d874980d8d1a616e92d3f528586ca87b6f76255e3c8dd8bf4c72d4b4a", "ja": "あれは……伴田さんでは、ないようです。", "zh": "那位……好像不是伴田小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "99ff958d988276fb7bc076ce76e8188a756168a5a6f0cb41c34621b4864cbe98", "ja": "伴田さんによく似た、人形に見えます。\n……どういうことでしょう？", "zh": "看起来是一个和伴田小姐很像的人偶。\n……这是怎么回事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1018_se", "source_sha256": "90d520655011510485f6d55f1da7d9fa0fb6c086509870309e75aa7305f1500b", "ja": "バタンッ", "zh": "砰", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "afc6bd641a6f6f7a02584fe1e56d1fc39250470f26ed0907c1b7a83f3fe827a1", "ja": "！？\n……永吉さんと、七尾さんが。", "zh": "！？\n……是永吉小姐和七尾小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "974d98041ec551cd226e51fb7d9e4991941350c4f828fbedc2f79453da5683fa", "ja": "……に、人形が……倒れてる……？\n昴さんと百合子さんの……人形……？", "zh": "……人、人偶……倒在地上……？\n昂小姐和百合子小姐的……人偶……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "c476d99e3511ec5c009ede38c43efcbef4367cd274a79979b5557f7f59d9cefc", "ja": "先ほどまで、永吉さんと七尾さんがいたはず。\nなのに、どうして人形が？", "zh": "刚才永吉小姐和七尾小姐应该还在这里才对。\n可是，为什么会有人偶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "57f877e98f088d3cb800366bcc4f5cbd7fae208a9dac7a857af9f3571414639b", "ja": "人知を超えた何かが起こっているようです。\n望月さん、とにかくいったん、ここから逃げましょう。", "zh": "看来发生了超越人类认知的某种事情。\n望月小姐，总之我们先逃离这里吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "a6f55507b7242a8d9a0aa92faaac45e361d1ef6a6ec8c96283d7d2e31a6a129f", "ja": "うん……！", "zh": "嗯……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1024_onnnasyujin", "source_sha256": "dbef772c475c7393fcf9bf6970e26cc00e5b6497125f87f888272256a7623f45", "ja": "あら、そう簡単にいくとお思いかしら？", "zh": "哎呀，你以为会这么简单吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1025_024ann", "source_sha256": "4da7820a2c69b9c10a57ea877d8bbd13d55f803e00680022600583355e17a109", "ja": "えっ……あっ！？", "zh": "诶……啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1026_se", "source_sha256": "2fba835ba465d4b3d237ecfd86e917aa1b9f4279e2ed3055ef9aafaf95110b59", "ja": "ガタンッ", "zh": "咣当！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0429_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_02_1027_onnnasyujin", "source_sha256": "34036e7c1f170d2758dbd060fa51faeff313bd7c9662ea0c14b3c5fb78cd4497", "ja": "お腹がいっぱいで、上手く動けないでしょう？\n遠慮しないで、ここでゆっくりしていくといいわ……。", "zh": "吃得太饱，行动不便了吧？\n别客气，就在这里慢慢休息一会儿吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
